# Where the public event page's "Register in the EntryLink app" button points.
#   Installed app (dev/production build): entrylink://
#   Expo Go during development:           exp://<your-Mac's-Wi-Fi-IP>:8081/--/
VITE_APP_LINK_BASE=entrylink://
